## 3. Universal Mandatory Houdini Geometry Attribute Contract

Every SOP output `OUT_<Comp>` across ALL 4 archetypes MUST write these exact attributes before downstream export or UV unwrapping:

| Attribute | Class | Type | Purpose Downstream (`/zenray-uv` & `/zenray-height`) |
|---|---|---|---|
| `s@name` | Primitive | String | Exact component ID (`Arm_Flare`, `Trunk_Main`) required by `ZenRayUV.py` & Multi-Material splitting. |
| `s@zrm_archetype` | Detail | String | `plate_sym` / `plate_asym` / `organic_tube` / `tree_branch` for automated UV strategy selection. |
| `s@zrm_mat_family` | Primitive | String | Material group (`steel_armor`, `leather_strap`, `bark`, `skin`) mapped automatically to `CTRL_zruv.families` & M2/M1 sheets! |
| `edgegroup: zrm_seam_suggest` | Edge | Group | **Goldmine bridge**: Outer beveled rim borders, symmetry midline (`hidden_side`), back cavity lips, and tube back-seams pre-marked at mesh creation! |
| `edgegroup: zrm_crease` | Edge | Group | Yellow sharp features (`creaseweight > 0.5`) telling `UVSeamChecker` NOT to mistake sharp ridges or chamfer transitions carelessly vs flat closure cuts. |
| `v@uv_proxy` | Vertex | Vector | Intrinsic harmonic `(gu, gv, 0)` coordinates carried over from CMY 2.0 patches -> instant distortion-free quad straightening! |
